    {
      "task_id": "MANUAL-20261107-001",
      "source": "manual",
      "subject": "英语",
      "title": "兄弟英语对话第1期",
      "detail": "兄弟英语对话第1期：Our Weekend Plan（我们的周末计划）\n两人一起录3-5分钟，一次录完；角色A/B两人自行分配，不用报年级/不用说自己是谁，自然语速、发音清楚。\n\n对话脚本：\nA: Hi! The weekend is coming. Do you have any plans?\nB: Not yet. What about you?\nA: I want to go to the park on Saturday morning. Would you like to come with me?\nB: Sure! What can we do there?\nA: We can play football and have a picnic.\nB: Great idea! What food shall we bring?\nA: Sandwiches and apples. And some water.\nB: OK. What time shall we meet?\nA: At nine o'clock, at the park gate.\nB: Good. And what about Sunday?\nA: On Sunday morning, let's visit our grandparents.\nB: Good idea! We can read books with Grandma.\nA: And help Grandpa water the flowers.\nB: Sounds great! What about Sunday afternoon?\nA: Let's watch a cartoon movie at home.\nB: I love cartoons! What time shall we start?\nA: At three o'clock.\nB: OK. So: Saturday—park and picnic. Sunday—grandparents and a movie.\nA: Yes! It's going to be a happy weekend!\nB: See you on Saturday!\n\n关键词：weekend 周末；plan 计划；picnic 野餐；sandwich 三明治；gate 大门；visit 拜访；water the flowers 浇花；cartoon 卡通片；shall we…? 我们……好吗？；be going to 将要。\n发音小贴士：一般疑问句句尾升调，陈述句句尾降调；注意 sandwich 的 /dʒ/ 音。\n\n录音提交：录音走看板任务按钮交（不走邮箱，邮箱已停扫）。两人一起录的同一段录音，可由两人各自从自己的卡提交。\n积分按口语/背诵标准：按时发回+5、完成达标+3（达标标准：错词≤2且不改句意，同篇目达标只计一次）。批改时按 joint 对话处理、分别点评。\n",
